WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.509
A message worth keeping

00:00:02.509 --> 00:00:04.348
Even when connection drops

00:00:04.348 --> 00:00:09.148
Still here. Ready to retry.

00:00:09.148 --> 00:00:13.111
Back online. Sent once.

00:00:13.111 --> 00:00:19.126
A clear personal boundary

00:00:19.126 --> 00:00:22.167
The connection is removed
